WEBVTT

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.410
I will take all the yen in the Japan!

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.290
All of you can use this instead!

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.110
Inspector Ogino.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.980
The safe has been
completely emptied out.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.420
This is the sixth bank to be hit.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.420
Despite having heavy
security at the location,

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.720
the suspect got in easily.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.510
Damn you, Don Valentino!

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:35.970
I guess it's time to use Hiroshi.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.310
Hiroshi?!

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.930
Are you talking about Inaba Hiroshi?

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.820
The werewolf police dog
who became a legend

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.690
by tracking down a suspect
with just a single hair.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.960
With his power, he's able to identify
anyone just by touching their hair,

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.380
and he can see their memories by
putting the hair into his mouth.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.550
His apprehension rate is 100%.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.100
He's truly the guard dog of the law.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:00:59.990
Inaba Detective Agency

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:05.160
Cuticle Detective

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.500
Cuticle Detective
Inaba

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:08.540
Counterfeit Currency
Printing Incident
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.420
Meeting Room

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:14.550
Hey.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:15.800
Ogi-san!

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.980
You've got some nerve
showing up uninvited.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.460
I'm here with a job.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.110
We're after a bank robber,
but he's giving us some trouble.

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:32.890
I need your help.
Let's work together again, Hiroshi.

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.070
No way in hell!

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.730
I quit being a police dog!
Take that and that!

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:41.030
Inaba-san, that's rock salt!

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.100
I'm currently detectiving
to rave reviews!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.040
That's why I came here as a client.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.750
Is that any way to treat a client?!

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:48.940
Like I care, you stingy-haired miser!

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.140
Your hair is bristled
but you never let m—

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:52.120
Now, now... How about some tea?

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.590
Oh, sorry.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.200
We're currently out of bowls, so it'll be

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.900
straight out of the rice
maker. Is that okay?

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.430
Oh, good, ochazuke.
I was just getting hungry.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.760
Would you two quit spatting like
a mother-in-law and daughter?!

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:03.480
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:04.150
Yuuta-kun, we have cups, don't we?!
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:05.910
Tempted by the hourly wage,
I've been working at the

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:06.740
It's fine. I'll drink out of this.
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:07.410
Inaba Detective Agency
for six months now.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:09.450
Would you stop being weirdly
stubborn, Ogi-san?!

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:11.780
I'm Nozaki Kei, currently sixteen.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.190
And I'm totally into cats.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.670
Jeez. It seems your moodiness
hasn't changed.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.150
I'm totally in a <i>great</i> mood!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.950
Wanna see the cuticle dance?

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:24.140
Created by Inaba Hiroshi
Cuticle Dance

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:24.180
Cuticle, cuticle...
Created by Inaba Hiroshi
Cuticle Dance

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:28.150
Cuticle, cuticle...

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:29.130
Shiny, sleek hair...

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.150
My boss, Inaba Hiroshi-san,

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.320
is a former police dog werewolf
detective with a hair fetish.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:35.100
Cuticle, cuticle...

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.110
His self-appointed volunteer
assistant who understands him,

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:38.060
Soft, silky hair...

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.540
Sasaki Yuuta-kun,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.010
is a cross-dresser who has hostile
feelings towards Ogi-san.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:42.450
Kyu, kyu, kyu, kyu, kyu, kyu...

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.150
Inspector Ogino Kuniharu,

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:45.910
Inaba-san's partner when
he was a police dog,

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:48.100
is sort of like his owner.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.510
Hey, you, the assistant
that actually works.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:50.530
It's Kei.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:51.810
Cuticle, cuticle...

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.270
I'll tell you the details.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.140
Glossy, smooth...
Okay.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.300
You see...
Glossy, smooth...

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.820
Curse you, Bristles!

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.160
You look happy.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.620
Don... Valentino?

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:06.190
He's the boss of an
Italian Mafia group.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.330
He's quite skilled in making
counterfeit bills.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:11.540
However, there hadn't been
any activity from him

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.170
since the Italian currency changed.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.920
So it was believed that his
organization dissolved,

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.880
but surprisingly, he was in Japan.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:18.630
Look.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.090
Other than not having
Yukichi's face, it's a perfect copy.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.890
You totally can't tell other than
Yukichi's face being different.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.370
It should be obvious
if it's not Yukichi!

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.840
Though he's an enemy,
his work is admirable.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.560
I would love for him to make a 10,000
yen bill with my daughter on it.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.900
I'll have him make you
the 5,000 yen bill, Hiroshi.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:36.780
Y-You idiot.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.860
Hey, could you two come
back to reality now?

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:39.120
Hurry and leave.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.110
But this can't actually be classified
as counterfeit, can it?

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:40.780
Hurry and leave.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.680
I'm telling you to
hurry up and leave!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:42.360
You're right.
I'm telling you to
hurry up and leave!

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:46.420
The ICPO has analyzed that this
fake bill is a display of

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.220
their counterfeiting
technique, and as long as

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.550
they're packing cash,
they'll take any requests.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:52.540
The ICPO?

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.990
We've tracked down their hideout.

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:55.880
Hiroshi,

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:59.090
use your powers to
bring them to justice.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.090
What color is Valentino's hair?

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.660
Is that really important?

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.970
It's top priority.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:07.820
I think it's white.

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:10.830
I wonder if it's white or gray.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.310
Either way, it's been a while.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.680
This will be my first time
getting a luxurious hair

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:15.810
from someone like an Italian Mafia Don.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:16.940
Something like this?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.270
Stop it, Yuuta.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.280
Inaba-san, it's too dangerous!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.240
Don't stop me, Kei.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.200
I can't stop drooling over the
idea of an unknown cuticle.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:27.160
Actually, I think I'm turning
into drool itself.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.470
I'll catch Valentino for you!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.620
Hurry up and lead me to him, Ogi!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:38.210
A single-story house made of wood...

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.290
It reminds me of home.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.570
It is, indeed, a very
family friendly home.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:43.480
Seriously?! Is it really
okay for Valentino to be

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.740
in a single-story wooden house?!

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.720
We know you're in there, Valentino!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.720
He may have fled.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.180
No, I can hear voices.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:53.960
Those newspaper guys
just never give up.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.830
Could you tell them we
don't want any, Don?

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.690
I suppose I'll have to tell them to scram.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.750
I'm going to call the police, I am.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:18.980
I am the police.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:19.960
He's a goat!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:20.480
He's a goat living in a
one-story wooden house!

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:20.790
Slip!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:21.560
He's a goat living in a
one-story wooden house!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.150
It's a crock that he's called Valentino!

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.670
Lorenzo! Lorenzo, who is my right arm!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.990
Kill them now!

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.600
Make a run for it, Don!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.100
Lorenzo! Bag on head!
Traditional Japanese clothing!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:32.920
Good for him.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.060
He has a gun?

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:37.090
Ah!

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:37.550
Ah!  Whoops.
Ah!

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:38.150
Ah!  Whoops.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:40.900
Too slow.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.280
I didn't think they'd shoot suddenly.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.540
All of you hide in here.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.650
Okay, Papa.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.950
You're so cool, Papa.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:47.970
Hurry ho—

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.200
Ogi-san, you're bleeding!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.010
I've been shot.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.450
How are you okay?!

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.050
Someone please teach Ogi-san
not to be so trusting.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:07.790
Oh, no!

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.830
Yuuta-kun, don't! It's too dangerous!

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:13.740
He sealed it!

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.470
The Mafia is Surprised!
He sealed it!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.410
Let me know whenever you want some air

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.680
by saying, "I'm a lowly
dog of the state."

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:23.940
Assistant. Kill.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.440
The strong-looking one
has been sealed, he has!

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.900
Come at me now, you should!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:32.330
Sensei, it's too dangerous for us
now that Ogi-san is gone.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.330
Let's hurry and run away.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.620
My Yukichis are sticking
out, they are!

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:37.660
I don't understand.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.820
You have the skills to make
such convincing counterfeits.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.380
Why steal real money?

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.840
You impudent amateur.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.420
I shall show you why the
counterfeits came about, I shall.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.010
Lorenzo!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.840
Don, do not bang on the bowl.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.570
Yukichi in light soy sauce.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.850
What a refreshing dish, it is.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:02.450
I have tried many others,
but the Japanese yen is the best, it is.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.460
It's light, yet flavorful.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.290
The euro is too plain.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.150
Things were great when
they still had the lira.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.030
And now, Don, if you'll excuse me...

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.880
It is complete, it is!

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:24.940
Valentino Specialty Counterfeit Bills

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:25.960
All done.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.210
Commoner punch!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.070
Public opinion kick! Public opinion kick!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:30.490
His rage toward tightness on
money is nothing to laugh at.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:32.350
S-Stop it, I say!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.240
That hurts, it does!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:33.730
I've never seen Kei-kun keep
dishing out low kicks like that.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.600
Public opinion kick! Public opinion kick!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.360
I can't forgive him, Inaba-san!

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.540
Oh, leave it to me.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.430
Hiroshi, if you're able
to catch Valentino,

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.130
I'll let you shampoo my hair.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.280
Leave it to me!

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.650
Where are you popping out from?!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.170
It's up to you, Yuuta.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.320
Poke Poke Poke

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.280
That one-finger move is known as the secret technique of mountain sages...

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.530
Hamusenryuu!

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:56.580
That move is so secret that
it has never been seen!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.540
Having shady people explain a shady attack
just makes it all the more shady...

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.920
It has been determined that
you're going to jail, Valentino!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.920
A wolf?!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.690
Are you telling me
that rumor was true?

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:12.480
The DNA of werewolves that
has been secretly passed

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:13.930
down from medieval Europe...

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.030
Secret Doberman!

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:20.390
I heard that all of the werewolves
in Japan had gone extinct.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:23.810
Too bad! As you can see,
I'm fine and dandy!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.520
Kill! Kill! Kill!
I'm going to kill all wolves!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:32.050
Be sure not to open the door,
no matter who comes to it.

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:33.510
Okay!

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:36.300
I'm your Momma!

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.280
Die! I will take revenge
for those kids!

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:41.370
They were saved!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.840
What kind of vile creature
would try to eat kids?!
The Wolf and the Seven Little Kids

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.710
It's no use. He's completely lost it!
Have you no pity?!

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.920
Yet he's calm when loading the gun.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:49.930
It's up to you, Yuuta!

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:52.380
Right! I've got a quality
black one right here.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.940
What can you do with
a single strand of hair?

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:57.140
Surrender, you should.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.480
While in his transformation,

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.140
he can gain the powers from
the hair he's chewing on.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.410
That one was black, so...

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.070
He's crafty now?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:08.110
This is the first time you're
seeing black, isn't it?

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.470
Watch.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.590
That negative aura pouring
out from Sensei...

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:15.260
This miasma has the
power to throw anyone

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.280
within 500 meters into
complete and utter despair.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.780
Even the building is deteriorating!

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:24.620
To put it simply, it's a negative
aura that depresses anyone.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.500
How are you okay, Yuuta-kun?

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.150
I don't feel like doing anything.

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:30.710
My body's heavy.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.580
I don't think I even
care about common sense

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.910
or anything else anymore.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.700
If you're discarding your status
as the sensible character,

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.180
then there's no use for you, Kei-kun!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:43.210
This aura eats up any
hope in your heart.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:46.720
And then turns your hair black!

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.210
I don't even care about the fact

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.150
that Inaba-san has turned
into the villain...

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:50.890
The staff is also
being affected
by the miasma.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.990
I don't even care about the
fact that Valentino has

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:54.110
turned into a black goat...
The staff is also
being affected
by the miasma.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:57.270
As much as I eat bills and sip
on sweet drinks every day,

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.700
I'm bound to become fat, I am.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:09:59.990
I'm not even getting pissed anymore...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.780
My name should be
the Golden Fatty, Don Metaborich.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.670
I don't even care about life anymore...

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:03.680
My name should be
the Golden Fatty, Don Metaborich.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:05.500
Even Lorenzo...

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.470
The hell?!

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:11.450
Has the Don riding a white
horse arrived yet?

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:13.380
How are you so full of
hopes and dreams?!

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:16.340
Oh, flower, tell me how
the Don truly feels.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.680
This isn't the time for that, flower!

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.340
The Don considers Lorenzo
to be his right arm!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:21.850
Left arm...

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.930
Right arm!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.980
Left, right, left, right, left,
right, left, right, le—

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:30.810
Seppuku!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.860
Who could die in good conscience
from a random sword test like this?!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.630
That was close.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.290
Lorenzo, how dare you?!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:37.820
Ogi-san, your revival is too strange!

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.870
It's too dangerous to be here with that man.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.950
We are withdrawing.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.900
You'll regret this, you will!

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.410
Realize what era you're in!

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.830
We'll call the family, we will.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.990
We shall research him, make him face

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:53.040
the same fear as the kids did, and kill him.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:57.550
The Valentino family will crush
the wolf at full force, we will.

