That's all you've got, and you were
expecting to win against me?

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:00.900
The hell are you? A girl ninja?!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.900
If you want to beat me...

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.030
You'll have to try to kill me!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:06.420
Says the person who
looks like a near-sighted

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:07.870
anime character from the Showa era.

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:11.580
I've got your Don.
Don't you have to save him?

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:13.560
I don't want the Don.
Give me your assistant!

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.510
No!

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:15.710
Miser! I'm going home!

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.640
H-Hey, wait... Gabriella?!

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.300
Come back, Gabriella!

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.100
Where's Azusa?

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:25.680
Hey, Ogi. Azusa's fine.

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:28.640
More importantly,
I've apprehended Valentino.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.850
When?!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:38.110
You're a Don! What the hell are
you getting captured for?

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:39.620
Since I saved you, how about you sing

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.670
a song from that dirty
little mouth of yours?

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:42.940
B-Bah...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.270
Damn it, your breath stinks!

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:46.280
Don!

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:49.110
Gabriella! Stop dominating
your elders!

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:52.030
Shut up! Stop ordering me around!

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:53.520
Don!

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:28.860
Inaba was pretty damn funny.

00:23:28.860 --> 00:23:31.070
By the way, who do you like?

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:32.720
Azusa.

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:34.050
She's chopping down a tree!

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:36.470
Her teeth are intense!

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:37.470
That's what's great about her.

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:39.730
Watch next week, too!
